---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bidwell Capital - Building Generational Wealth Through Cash-Flowing Assets" description="Bidwell Capital partners with investors to build long-term wealth through productive real assets, disciplined underwriting, and trusted operator relationships.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label fade-up fade-up-1">Bidwell Capital</span>
      <h1 class="fade-up fade-up-2">Building generational wealth<br/>through cash-flowing assets</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub fade-up fade-up-3">Bidwell Capital partners with investors to build long-term wealth through productive real assets, disciplined underwriting, and trusted operator relationships.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions fade-up fade-up-4">
        <a href="/philosophy" class="btn btn-primary">View Investment Philosophy</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Connect With Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro / Philosophy -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container intro-narrow">
      <span class="section-label">Our Approach</span>
      <h2>Productive assets, patient ownership, durable value.</h2>
      <p class="lede">We believe wealth is built through productive assets, patient ownership, and relationships developed over time. Rather than chasing trends, Bidwell Capital focuses on cash-flowing opportunities where experience, operational insight, and trusted partnerships can create durable value.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Invest In -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">What We Invest In</span>
      <h2>Three investment verticals, one philosophy.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Each vertical centers on cash flow, disciplined underwriting, and an operator we know and trust.</p>
      <div class="grid-3 verticals">
        <div class="card vertical-card">
          <span class="badge">Real Estate</span>
          <h3>Cash-Flowing Real Estate</h3>
          <p>Multifamily and select real estate opportunities where operations, management, and disciplined acquisition can create value over a long hold.</p>
          <a href="/what-we-invest-in#real-estate" class="card-link">Read more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card vertical-card">
          <span class="badge">Energy</span>
          <h3>Oil &amp; Gas</h3>
          <p>Income-producing energy assets through trusted operators, with attention to tax efficiency and a long-standing relationship at the center of our access.</p>
          <a href="/what-we-invest-in#energy" class="card-link">Read more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card vertical-card">
          <span class="badge">Private Credit</span>
          <h3>Private Credit / Income Strategies</h3>
          <p>Income-oriented positions with a capital-preservation mindset, underwriting discipline, and selectivity about the operators we lend behind.</p>
          <a href="/what-we-invest-in#private-credit" class="card-link">Read more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="disclaimer" style="margin-top: 2rem; max-width: 65ch;">All investments involve risk, including the possible loss of principal. Tax outcomes depend on individual circumstances and are not guaranteed. Nothing on this page constitutes an offer to sell or a solicitation of an offer to buy securities.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Makes Bidwell Different -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">What Makes Bidwell Different</span>
      <h2>A narrower focus, by design.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">We are not interested in chasing every market cycle or promoting every trending asset class. Our focus is narrower: cash-flowing assets, trusted partners, thoughtful underwriting, and long-term stewardship.</p>
      <div class="grid-3 diff-grid">
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Operator mindset</h3>
          <p>We are operators first, capital raisers second. We have run the businesses behind real assets and bring that experience to every underwrite.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Cash flow over speculation</h3>
          <p>We prefer assets that pay you to own them. Appreciation, when it comes, is a secondary outcome we never count on.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Trusted operators only</h3>
          <p>We do not raise capital for operators we do not know personally. Long-term relationships are how we get access to the work that matters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Disciplined underwriting</h3>
          <p>We underwrite for downside first. Conservative assumptions, stress-tested cases, and a clear view of how each thesis can fail.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Tax-conscious structuring</h3>
          <p>We pay attention to how investments are structured for tax efficiency, alongside the broader return profile. Outcomes vary by investor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card diff-card">
          <h3>Built for the long term</h3>
          <p>This is not a sprint, a trend, or a transaction. We build for generational wealth and steward capital with that horizon in mind.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founder -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Founder</span>
      <div class="founder-grid">
        <div class="founder-photo">
          <img src="/photos/adam-penn.jpg" alt="Adam Penn, Founder of Bidwell Capital" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="founder-bio">
          <h2>Adam Penn</h2>
          <p>Adam Penn began investing in 2017 and has spent nearly a decade acquiring, operating, and building businesses around cash-flowing real assets. With a background in software engineering, Adam brings a systems-first, data-driven approach to investing and operations.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">His experience across real estate, short-term rental operations, private credit, and energy investments shapes Bidwell Capital's practical, operator-led investment philosophy.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">More About Bidwell</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Investment Philosophy -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label">Investment Philosophy</span>
      <h2>What we believe matters.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">A short list of the things we keep returning to when we evaluate an asset, a partner, or a structure.</p>
      <div class="philosophy-grid">
        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <h3>Cash flow matters</h3>
          <p>Income today is the foundation. We prefer assets that pay along the way, not just at exit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <h3>Taxes matter</h3>
          <p>After-tax returns are the only returns that count. We structure with that in mind.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <h3>Relationships matter</h3>
          <p>The operator is the deal. We invest behind people we know and have worked with over time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <h3>Operations matter</h3>
          <p>Real returns come from real work. We pay attention to how an asset is actually run.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <h3>Stewardship matters</h3>
          <p>We treat investor capital as a long-term responsibility, not a one-time transaction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-item">
          <h3>Patience matters</h3>
          <p>Durable wealth is built over decades. We are willing to wait for the right opportunities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
        <a href="/philosophy" class="btn btn-outline">Read the full philosophy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="container cta-wrap">
      <span class="section-label">Connect</span>
      <h2>Interested in learning more about Bidwell Capital's investment philosophy and current opportunities?</h2>
      <p class="cta-sub">We start with a conversation. No pitch, no pressure.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Connect With Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
    min-height: 60vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .intro-narrow {
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .intro-narrow h2 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .verticals .vertical-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .vertical-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .vertical-card p {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .card-link {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .diff-grid .diff-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .philosophy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .philosophy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1000px) {
    .philosophy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .philosophy-item {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .philosophy-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .founder-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }

  .founder-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 280px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .founder-bio h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-wrap {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .cta-wrap h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    max-width: 30ch;
  }

  .cta-sub {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }
</style>
